ready: 1
kind: quality
id: consolidation.quality.no-starvation
display_id: QC-CONSOLIDATION-COVERAGE
module: consolidation
title: No processing transition starves another
applies_to:
  - consolidation.seq.process
  - consolidation.data.transition-mark
measure: >-
  For a stack with N eligible episodes and every episode transition enabled, the number of
  episodes each transition has examined after processing converges.
target: Every transition examines all N episodes; the same holds for both raw transitions over raw entries.
